sistent scales across multiple charts"],[1322,"Use **title case**: capitalize the first letter of each word, except short prepositions."],[303,"Use \\`\\<DrawerTrigger>\\` to wrap a trigger button and a \\`\\<Drawer>\\`. The drawer opens when the trigger is pressed."],[1649,"Use \\`areas\\` to define named grid regions. Children use the \\`gridArea\\` prop for placement."],[691,"Use \\`centered\\` to center the title and description, and \\`actionProps\\` to control the alignment and direction of the action buttons."],[339,"Use \\`children\\` as a render function to show different content based on the current zone state - here, swapping the default label for \"Drop to replace\" when a file is already selected and a new drag is active. The same \\`onDrop\\` handler services both the drag path and the \\`FileTrigger\\` click path, so either gesture replaces the selection."],[761,"Use \\`defaultActiveIndex\\` to set the starting page in uncontrolled mode."],[1187,"Use \\`design=\"inline\"\\` to embed a tag within a sentence. The background and border are removed so the tag blends into the text flow."],[1455,"Use \\`formatValue\\` when the raw numbers in the tooltip should read like money, counts with separators, or whatever your product expects. The percentage of the total still formats on its own; your function only shapes the value column."],[732,"Use \\`hideStepper\\` to show only the input without +/- buttons."],[731,"Use \\`isDisabled\\` to prevent input."],[1243,"Use \\`isDisabled\\` to prevent input."],[1045,"Use \\`isDisabled\\` to prevent interaction."],[940,"Use \\`isDisabled\\` when the value is visible but unavailable for interaction."],[563,"Use \\`isExpanded\\` and \\`onExpandedChange\\` to drive state externally."],[730,"Use \\`isInvalid\\` with \\`errorMessage\\` for validation feedback."],[1044,"Use \\`isInvalid\\` with \\`errorMessage\\` for validation feedback."],[1242,"Use \\`isInvalid\\` with \\`errorMessage\\` for validation feedback."],[307,"Use 